      "content": "that \"salami slicing\" thing is exactly what it feels like. it's like they're trying to gaslight me into thinking nothing is wrong while they slowly strip everything away. if they eventually succeed in making me quit or burn out, they win. how do i actually start building a dossier on this? i need to prove this is a coordinated effort and not just \"random\" stuff so they can't claim it's just bad luck when i take them to court.",
